  "goodToKnow": "Straffrei means exempt from punishment: straffrei bleiben, straffrei ausgehen. A well-known example is §218a of the criminal code: an abortion in the first twelve weeks after mandatory counselling is technically rechtswidrig but straffrei, a compromise from 1995 that is still debated. Die Straffreiheit is exemption from punishment. The opposite is strafbar (punishable)."
